      "concise_thought": "The test suite creates a new Faker instance without seeding, so Faker.generator._is_seeded is False. In faker/providers/misc/__init__.py, Provider.binary checks this flag: when False it returns os.urandom(length) (line\u202f61). os.urandom produces a new random byte string on each call, so the returned value differs across runs. Therefore the invariant that all 15 parametrized tests return the same bytes in all 10 runs does not hold.",
