        "3. Confirm that Faker() without seed leaves generator._is_seeded False.",
        "4. Understand that os.urandom generates a new random sequence each call, not deterministic.",
        "5. Conclude that binary(length) will produce different bytes on each run for any length >0 (and even for 0 it returns empty bytes but still not invariant across runs)."
